# Local scan/projection output dumps written to the repo root during dev runs.
# Real runs should use --out-dir or a path outside the repo; never commit dumps.
/*_out.json

# Windows reserved device names — accidental shell-redirect artifacts.
# `command > nul` (or `2> nul`) on Windows can create a literal file named `nul`
# when the redirect is interpreted as a path rather than the device. Gitignore it
# so the artifact never gets committed. See #1797.
nul
